Package: firmware-studio
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         python3-pymcuprog
Description: Firmware for HiFiBerry Studio sound card microcontrollers
 Prebuilt firmware binaries for the ATtiny microcontrollers on HiFiBerry
 Studio sound cards, plus a helper to flash them over UPDI using pymcuprog.
 .
 Currently ships the Studio DAC8x firmware (v0.0.2). The firmware turns the
 on-board ATtiny402 into an I2C controller (slave 0x10) that presents the
 universal sound-card register map and drives the four PCM5242 DACs.
